  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass $100 \\mathrm{~g}$ is thrown vertically upwards with a speed of $5 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$. the work done by the force of gravity during the time the particle goes up is",
    "image": null
  },
